    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Bar Tariff\nFirst Class\nValid from March 1980\nBritish Caledonian",
      "Haig.\nThe name for Scotch the world over.\nHAIG\nJeNN HAIc a CoLTa\nBy a distance.\nEXTRA QUALITY\nBRUT\nCHAMPAGNE\ntanson\nReins FRANCEI\nMaison Fondée en 1760\nPRODUCE OF FRANCE\nCigarettes - per 20\nper 200\nCigars - Vada\nWillem II Senoritas\nHamlet Panatellas\nWillem II Corona\nWhisky\nGin\nBrandy\nCigarette Lighter\nColibri Molectric Gold Plated\nWrist Watches\nLadies\nGents\nFirst Class Bar Tariff\nSterling\n10s\n10s\n5s\nSs\n5 bottle\n3 bottle\n3 bottle\nL bottle\n.40\n4.00\n1.50\n1.50\n1.00\n1.00\n1.75\n1.75\n1.75\n2.75\n15.00\n15.00\n15.00\nPerfumes\nLanvin\nArpege\nDior\nMiss Dior Perfume\nMiss Dior Eau de Cologne\nChanel\nNo. 5 Perfume\nNo. 5 Eau de Toilette Spray\nA Gentleman's After Shave\nWorth\nJe Reviens\nJe Reviens Eau de Toilette\nMadame Rochas\nPerfume\nParfum de Toilette\nCarven\nMa Griffe Parfum Atomiser\nMa Griffe Eau de Toilette\nNina Ricci\nL'Air du Temps\nL'Air du Temps\nEau de Toilette\nSignor Ricci After Shave\nLenthéric\nTweed Bouquet Spray\nElizabeth Arden\nBlue Grass Perfumair\nBlue Grass\nEau de Parfum Spray\n7.5 ml\n7.5 ml\n54 ml\n5 ml\n45 ml\n60 ml\n5 ml\n63 ml\n5 ml\n57 ml\n7.5 ml\n45 ml\n7.0 ml\n60 ml\n100 ml\n60 ml\n5 ml\n70 g\nSterling\n9.00\n9.00\n4.50\n9.00\n8.00\n4.50\n6.00\n6.00\n7.50\n7.50\n7.50\n4.00\n9.00\n6.00\n4.50\n3.00\n3.00\n3.00\nNotes:\n(i) Since our supplies are limited by both weight and volume kindly\naccept our apologies in the event of any article of your choice not\nbeing available.\n(i) Payment for duty-free purchases will normally only be accepted in\nflight. On request the Cabin Staff will advise the current currency\nrates being utilised.\n(iii) Certain currencies are not acceptable due to local exchange\ncontrol restrictions.\nSterling or in the currencies of the destinations being served by this\nBritish Caledonian\nSp 0427D Mar 80"
